    }(name='AgentSilenceConfig', description='The configuration for agent behavior during silence timeout. When a user joins the channel but does not interact effectively with the agent (the user does not speak), the agent is in a silent state. You can configure the agent to broadcast a voice messaging reminder or send a webhook notification during this silent state.'),
