Default value: 0.8.', example='0.8'),
      url?: string(name='Url', description='The endpoint URL for integrating a third-party LLM.', example='https://xxxxx'),
      vendor?: string(name='Vendor', description='The name of the service provider when a cloud service provider is integrated. Examples: aliyun for Model Studio, thirdparty.', example='aliyun'),
    }(name='LLMConfig', description='The large language model (LLM) configuration.'),
    TTSConfig?: {
      apiKey?: string(name='ApiKey', description='The API key of the service provider.', example='xxxxxx'),
      filterBrackets?: [ int32 ](name='FilterBrackets', description='The configuration to filter out characters within specified brackets from text-to-speech conversion.', example='[1,2]'),
      model?: string(name='Model', description='The model name. Example: cosyvoice-v1.', example='cosyvoice-v1'),
      pitch?: double(name='Pitch', description='The pitch.
Valid values: 0.5 to 2.0.
Default value: 1.0.', example='1'),
      rate?: double(name='Rate', description='The speech rate.
