longwan, longcheng, longhua, longxiaochun, longxiaoxia, longxiaocheng, longxiaobai, longlaotie, longshu, longshuo, longjing, longmiao, longyue, longyuan, longfei, longjielidou, longtong, longxiang, loongstella, and loongbella.', example='longxiaoxia'),
      volume?: int32(name='Volume', description='The volume.
Valid values: 0 to 100.
Default value: 50.', example='50'),
    }(name='TTSConfig', description='The text-to-speech (TTS) configuration.'),
    preferVideo?: int32(name='preferVideo', description='After visual understanding is enabled, you can specify the video stream that the agent prioritizes for understanding. The agent can understand only one video stream when both the camera stream and the screen sharing stream are pushed simultaneously.

1. The agent prioritizes the camera stream.
