Valid values of N: **1 to 16**.', example='camera'),
      texts?: [ 
        {
          fontColor?: int32(name='FontColor', description='The text color in RGB format. The calculation formula is R + G × 256 + B × 65536. Valid values of R (red), G (green), and B (blue): **0 to 255**.', example='0'),
          fontSize?: int32(name='FontSize', description='The font size. Valid values: **(0, 72]**.', example='1'),
          fontType?: int32(name='FontType', description='The font type. Valid values:

